# LF everywhere, on every platform. This is not a style preference: the harness HASHES files.
# skills-lock.json pins a sha256 per skill file, a phase receipt is a hash of the handoff block, and
# branch-sync compares shared files byte for byte. A checkout that converts to CRLF changes every one
# of those digests without anyone having edited anything, and the gates go red on one machine only.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
